      "created_at": "2014-02-14T16:18:21.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I made my wife Sangria last night, so that is getting prepared, then I'm making Chicken Tacos.</p><p>Sadly my plans of getting flowers and chocolate fell through, she missed her bus and took the car.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Still should be a good night. &nbsp;No Sentinels though, she's supportive of my nerdery but she prefers games like Cards Against Humanity, Dictionary and Scrabble.</p><p>Can't wait to test the viability of 2 hero Vengeance, then we could play without anyone having to control 2 heroes, which she really dislikes.</p>",
