      "created_at": "2014-02-14T20:01:46.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Me and the girlfriend are grabbing a nice dinner, a slice of cake, then heading back to the apartment to drink wine until we're silly.&nbsp; We'll probably break out some Android Netrunner if we're not too drunk/randy.</p><p>Vengeance just came yesterday, but I haven't had the chance to test it out yet, which is a bummer.&nbsp; I'd bring it along, but I've only gotten her to play once and while she liked it, I'm not sure she's ready to play two hero decks at once and help me keep track of all the Vengeance craziness.&nbsp; Next time though, once I'm more experienced with the mechanics.</p>",
