      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/silverleaf/{size}/2332_2.png",
      "created_at": "2014-02-15T01:52:49.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Well I realised (by reading this forum, incidentally) about 12 minutes after midnight and I really hadn't known what the date was.</p><p>I mentioned this to my boyfriend and he responded in a way that leads me to believe that he hadn't realised either.</p><p>Not that we ever do anything for Valentine's anyway, so it didn't matter at all.&nbsp;</p>",
